{"translation":{"id":"kan_irv","name":"ಇಂಡಿಯನ್ ರಿವೈಜ್ಡ್ ವರ್ಸನ್ (IRV) - ಕನ್ನಡ - 2019","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=kanirv","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=kanirv","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"IRV","englishName":"Kannada Indian Revised Version Bible","language":"kan","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"82cc741009376c81c4416c230a757b2e30ef49b2e4672f9831adcedfc26b865f","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/kan_irv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31031,"languageName":"ಕನ್ನಡ","languageEnglishName":"Kannada"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"kan_irv","name":"ಕೀರ್ತನೆಗಳು","commonName":"ಕೀರ್ತನೆಗಳು","title":"ಕೀರ್ತನೆಗಳು","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"08dbfe5ddc486dec386dace7278fb86473155bcc396458e2e5b52a02b2d0a830","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_irv/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_irv/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":133,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ಐಕಮತ್ಯವು ಶ್ರೇಷ್ಠವಾದುದು"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["ಯಾತ್ರಾಗೀತೆ; ದಾವೀದನದು."]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ಆಹಾ, ಸಹೋದರರು ಒಂದಾಗಿರುವುದು,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಎಷ್ಟೋ ಒಳ್ಳೆಯದು, ಎಷ್ಟೋ ರಮ್ಯವಾದದ್ದು!","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಅದು ಆರೋನನ ತಲೆಯ ಮೇಲೆ ಹಾಕಲ್ಪಟ್ಟು,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಅವನ ಗಡ್ಡದ ಮೇಲೆಯೂ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಅವನ ಅಂಗಿಗಳ ಕೊರಳ ಪಟ್ಟಿಯವರೆಗೂ ಹರಿದು ಬರುವ ಶ್ರೇಷ್ಠ ತೈಲದಂತೆಯೂ,","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಹೆರ್ಮೋನ್ ಪರ್ವತದಲ್ಲಿ ಹುಟ್ಟಿ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಚೀಯೋನ್ ಪರ್ವತದ ಮೇಲೆ ಬೀಳುವ ಮಂಜಿನಂತೆಯೂ ಇದೆ.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಅಲ್ಲಿ ಆಶೀರ್ವಾದವೂ, ಜೀವವೂ ಸದಾಕಾಲ ಇರಬೇಕೆಂದು,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಯೆಹೋವನು ಆಜ್ಞಾಪಿಸಿದ್ದಾನೆ.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/kan_irv/PSA/133.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_irv/PSA/134.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_irv/PSA/132.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":3}